== Part S: the canonical square action, one Fourier mode (rho_b = B cos kx, rho_c = C cos kx)
  S1 (ID) on-shell <L> = B*K*(B + 2*C)/(4*k**2);  Newtonian -V = K*(B + C)**2/(4*k**2)
      C^2 coefficient 0 (Newtonian K/(4*k**2)); BC K/(2*k**2) (Newtonian K/(2*k**2)); B^2 K/(4*k**2) -> carrier self-gravity CANCELLED exactly; mutual baryon-carrier term Newtonian
  S2 (coupling G, matter term -(rho_b + rho_c) Phi): (Phi' - K P)' = K*(B + C)*cos(k*x)  -> law source includes rho_c: True
  S3 (ID, dP/dx = rho_c, matter term -rho_b Phi):     (Phi' - K P)' = B*K*cos(k*x)  -> law source baryons only: True
  S4 longitudinal P: <|dP/dx|^2> = <rho_c^2> (True); 3-D |k|^2|P_hat|^2 = |rho_hat|^2 (True) -> (gamma/2)|grad P|^2 = pi G L*^2 rho_c^2: a local repulsive self-energy (pressure pi G L*^2 rho_c^2)

